{
  "text": "QR ADMIN\nBranch\nAll restaurant\nUI Audit Restaurant A — Main Branch\nUI Audit Second Branch A\nSign out\nBrowse workspace\nQR ORDERING / MENU & GUESTS\nCustomers & Loyalty\n\nManage shared customers, point balances, rewards and verified visit history.\n\nEnabled\nCustomers & loyalty\n\nCustomer profiles and point balances are shared with your restaurant's POS and verified QR checkout. Customer order history below follows the selected branch. Points are earned only after confirmed collection; guests verify their phone before using rewards.\n\nAdd customer\nLoyalty program\nRefresh customers\n\nProgram active / Earn 1 points per ₹100 paid. You can manage the restaurant-wide program.\n\nGuest reward setup\n\nRestaurant program: Active\n\nQR rewards for this branch: Not enabled\n\nPhone verification: Ready\n\nOpen branch reward settings\n\nGuests can redeem when all three checks are ready and an active reward matches their balance.\n\nCustomer segment\nAll customers\nReturning guests (2+ visits)\nCustomers with points\nEmail consent recorded\nWhatsApp consent recorded\nOwner export scope\nCustomer records (no email marketing list)\nConsented email contacts\nConsented WhatsApp contacts\n\nExports are audited. Do not use a customer-record export for campaigns without channel-specific consent.\n\nExport customer CSV\nFind customer by name or phone\n\n8 matching customers\n\nDaksh QR CRM Audit\n\n9870000345\n\n400 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nDaksh QR CRM Audit\n\n9870051650\n\n200 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nDaksh QR CRM Audit\n\n9870056885\n\n0 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nDaksh QR CRM Audit\n\n9870094583\n\n200 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nQR consent browser\n\n9880036451\n\n0 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nQR consent browser\n\n9880043653\n\n0 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nQR consent browser\n\n9880051361\n\n0 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nQR consent browser\n\n9880087681\n\n0 points\n\n0 paid visits / ₹0 lifetime spend\n\nPoints & history\nEdit customer\nFirst customers\nMore customers\nRewards guests can choose at checkout\n\nRedeeming is optional. Paused rewards cannot be redeemed; existing customer points are preserved.\n\nAdd bill reward\n₹100 off for 150 points\n\n150 points / Active\n\nEdit reward\n₹100 off for 150 points\n\n150 points / Active\n\nEdit reward\n₹100 off for 150 points\n\n150 points / Active\n\nEdit reward\n₹100 off for 150 points\n\n150 points / Active\n\nEdit reward\nExpired browser QA reward\n\n150 points / Expired\n\nEdit reward\nExpired browser QA reward\n\n150 points / Expired\n\nEdit reward",
